{"id":"eb795b338186fa75","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-thm-club-guessing-sequences.md","title":"Club Guessing","display":"thm-club-guessing-sequences — Club Guessing","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-club-guessing-sequences","aliases":["58-thm-club-guessing-sequences"],"display":"thm-club-guessing-sequences — Club Guessing","depends_on":["[[../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-order-type.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch20/58-df-club.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-club-guessing-sequences"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-club-guessing-sequences</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-club-guessing-sequences — Club Guessing"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md\">../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5d2cd56a38a81b7a\" href=\"?note=5d2cd56a38a81b7a\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-order-type.md\">../batch11/58-df-order-type.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"04670bdc8b64b8dd\" href=\"?note=04670bdc8b64b8dd\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-club.md\">../batch20/58-df-club.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa,S,\\vec C\\in V\">\\(\\kappa,S,\\vec C\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S,\\mathrm{Function},\\mathrm{Club},\\mathrm{OrderType}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S,\\mathrm{Function},\\mathrm{Club},\\mathrm{OrderType}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{cf}\">\\(\\operatorname{cf}\\)</span> (notions from dependencies)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}club\\text{-}guessing\\text{-}sequences}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\\land\\omega\\in\\kappa\\\\\n&amp;{}\\to\n\\exists S\\;\\exists\\vec C\\;\n\\Bigl[\nS=\\{\\alpha\\in\\kappa^+:\\operatorname{cf}(\\alpha)=\\kappa\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec C,S,\\mathcal P(\\kappa^+))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{18mm}\\land\n\\forall\\alpha\\in S\\;\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{Club}(\\vec C(\\alpha),\\alpha)\n\\land\\mathrm{OrderType}_S(\\kappa,\\vec C(\\alpha),\\in)\n\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{18mm}\\land\n\\forall E\\;\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{Club}(E,\\kappa^+)\n\\to\\exists\\alpha\\in S\\;(\\vec C(\\alpha)\\subseteq E)\n\\right)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}club\\text{-}guessing\\text{-}sequences}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\\land\\omega\\in\\kappa\\\\\n&amp;{}\\to\n\\exists S\\;\\exists\\vec C\\;\n\\Bigl[\nS=\\{\\alpha\\in\\kappa^+:\\operatorname{cf}(\\alpha)=\\kappa\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec C,S,\\mathcal P(\\kappa^+))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{18mm}\\land\n\\forall\\alpha\\in S\\;\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{Club}(\\vec C(\\alpha),\\alpha)\n\\land\\mathrm{OrderType}_S(\\kappa,\\vec C(\\alpha),\\in)\n\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{18mm}\\land\n\\forall E\\;\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{Club}(E,\\kappa^+)\n\\to\\exists\\alpha\\in S\\;(\\vec C(\\alpha)\\subseteq E)\n\\right)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Club guessing sequences guess all clubs.</li>\n<li>For every uncountable regular <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>, the displayed club-guessing sequence on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S^\\kappa_{\\kappa^+}\">\\(S^\\kappa_{\\kappa^+}\\)</span> is a theorem of ZFC, not merely a separate consistency assertion.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"0fbfc19800246e77","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-order-type.md","status":"resolved","id":"5d2cd56a38a81b7a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-order-type.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-club.md","status":"resolved","id":"04670bdc8b64b8dd","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-club.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa,S,\\vec C\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S,\\mathrm{Function},\\mathrm{Club},\\mathrm{OrderType}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{cf}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}club\\text{-}guessing\\text{-}sequences}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\\land\\omega\\in\\kappa\\\\\n&{}\\to\n\\exists S\\;\\exists\\vec C\\;\n\\Bigl[\nS=\\{\\alpha\\in\\kappa^+:\\operatorname{cf}(\\alpha)=\\kappa\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec C,S,\\mathcal P(\\kappa^+))\\\\\n&\\hspace{18mm}\\land\n\\forall\\alpha\\in S\\;\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{Club}(\\vec C(\\alpha),\\alpha)\n\\land\\mathrm{OrderType}_S(\\kappa,\\vec C(\\alpha),\\in)\n\\right)\\\\\n&\\hspace{18mm}\\land\n\\forall E\\;\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{Club}(E,\\kappa^+)\n\\to\\exists\\alpha\\in S\\;(\\vec C(\\alpha)\\subseteq E)\n\\right)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"S^\\kappa_{\\kappa^+}","display":false}],"bytes":1456,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4078","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-thm-club-guessing-sequences.md|58-thm-club-guessing-sequences]]（batch04）"}],"outgoing":["0fbfc19800246e77","5d2cd56a38a81b7a","36d7463d215be751","04670bdc8b64b8dd"]}